340
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:14,590
Are you scared?

341
00:22:14,720 --> 00:22:15,510
Get out!

342
00:22:17,440 --> 00:22:18,750
You are scared.

343
00:22:20,270 --> 00:22:23,030
This letter was kept by Hu Wenzhuo
for 9 years,

344
00:22:23,640 --> 00:22:25,970
but you never dared
to look back at it once.

345
00:22:26,070 --> 00:22:27,670
Because you wanted to forget

346
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:29,760
