360
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,110
We'll listen to you.

361
00:23:07,110 --> 00:23:07,680
Okay.

362
00:23:07,830 --> 00:23:10,860
The new Hengtang he painted
together with Shen Zhibai

363
00:23:11,070 --> 00:23:12,880
was something I yearned for.

364
00:23:13,240 --> 00:23:17,640
Those days were
the happiest time of my life.

365
00:23:18,270 --> 00:23:19,830
But the Xie family's secret

366
00:23:20,240 --> 00:23:23,310
will eventually swallow that light
inch by inch

367
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:25,790
and turn him into another person.

368
00:23:27,070 --> 00:23:28,270
Rather than saying

369
00:23:28,790 --> 00:23:31,630
[Mr. Xie Jingzhi]

370
00:23:28,920 --> 00:23:30,550
I want to save Shen Zhibai,

371
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:34,330
it's more accurate to say that
the person I want to rescue

372
00:23:35,110 --> 00:23:38,640
is that pitiful person
pushed into the abyss by fate,

373
00:23:39,550 --> 00:23:41,750
my once deeply loved husband,

374
00:23:42,550 --> 00:23:43,880
Xie Shu.

375
00:23:46,160 --> 00:23:47,270
Jingzhi.

376
00:23:48,070 --> 00:23:49,880
There is still time.

377
00:23:53,510 --> 00:23:55,310
Save Shen Zhibai,

378
00:23:58,660 --> 00:24:00,010
and help me

379
00:24:03,960 --> 00:24:06,000
