380
00:24:13,310 --> 00:24:14,070
Good.

381
00:24:16,070 --> 00:24:17,400
Very good.

382
00:24:19,350 --> 00:24:20,240
Qingyuan,

383
00:24:21,680 --> 00:24:24,160
I swear that every word I've said

384
00:24:25,790 --> 00:24:27,960
to you today is the truth.

385
00:24:28,680 --> 00:24:30,590
No matter what,

386
00:24:30,880 --> 00:24:32,030
I am,

387
00:24:32,430 --> 00:24:33,550
you could say,

388
00:24:35,070 --> 00:24:36,800
the one who killed your mother,

389
00:24:37,400 --> 00:24:39,030
