395
00:24:58,030 --> 00:25:00,200
Chunqing.

396
00:25:00,440 --> 00:25:03,200
But I actually killed her.

397
00:25:04,070 --> 00:25:05,400
Isn't it absurd?

398
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:07,030
Who else?

399
00:25:07,030 --> 00:25:08,240
Shen Zhibai,

400
