401
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:11,640
Everyone around me.

402
00:25:11,640 --> 00:25:13,750
I've killed too many.

403
00:25:13,750 --> 00:25:15,400
Too many of them.

404
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:17,070
I tried to pen it all down.

405
00:25:17,070 --> 00:25:19,070
I wrote them down and recalled them,

406
00:25:19,750 --> 00:25:21,410
