430
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:27,400
Those bastards of the Xie family!

431
00:26:29,510 --> 00:26:32,720
They took my Chunqing away...

432
00:26:33,720 --> 00:26:35,370
Those bastards!

433
00:26:36,720 --> 00:26:39,720
I'll make sure they were all raised
by your mother...

434
00:26:47,350 --> 00:26:49,400
Isn't it satisfying?

435
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:51,480
I'll avenge your mother...

436
00:26:58,790 --> 00:26:59,750
Chunqing...

437
