453
00:28:03,310 --> 00:28:04,240
I wouldn't dare.

454
00:28:04,430 --> 00:28:05,560
But Xie Shu

455
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:07,140
poisoned his beloved,

456
00:28:07,310 --> 00:28:08,570
killed his own father,

457
00:28:08,590 --> 00:28:10,160
drove his adoptive mother to her death,

458
00:28:10,160 --> 00:28:11,240
harmed the loyal and good,

459
00:28:11,240 --> 00:28:12,550
