sense of justice.

464
00:28:19,350 --> 00:28:22,160
If Xie Shu is removed,
Hengtang will fall into chaos.

465
00:28:22,160 --> 00:28:24,240
You are a man who has already died once.

466
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:27,240
How many lives do you have left
to clean up this mess for me?

467
00:28:27,240 --> 00:28:29,170
It's true that I only have one life,

468
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:30,790
but Shen Zhibai

469
00:28:31,310 --> 00:28:32,970
