483
00:29:03,200 --> 00:29:05,600
Please make a wise decision, Your Majesty.

484
00:29:07,480 --> 00:29:08,160
Good.

485
00:29:10,350 --> 00:29:12,080
What an innovation and change.

486
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:13,400
