what I just said.

503
00:29:49,400 --> 00:29:51,710
No matter how much she annoys me,

504
00:29:52,270 --> 00:29:53,400
I will always

505
00:29:54,200 --> 00:29:56,440
and forever be her father.

506
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:57,790
Everything I have

507
00:29:57,960 --> 00:29:59,880
