535
00:31:06,830 --> 00:31:09,270
I specially minted this silver coin.

536
00:31:09,550 --> 00:31:10,640
This is the beginning of our efforts

537
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:12,960
to build a better life for the people.

538
00:31:16,350 --> 00:31:17,400
Brother,

539
00:31:17,790 --> 00:31:19,310
as long as the two of us

540
00:31:19,310 --> 00:31:21,440
