544
00:31:28,830 --> 00:31:30,240
Yes, also.

545
00:31:31,160 --> 00:31:32,000
Brother,

546
00:31:32,150 --> 00:31:33,880
as for the policies
you wrote about in your articles:

547
00:31:33,880 --> 00:31:36,160
measuring the land,

548
00:31:36,400 --> 00:31:37,440
equalizing taxes,

549
00:31:37,440 --> 00:31:38,440
and collecting based on acreage.

550
00:31:38,440 --> 00:31:39,550
These are great policies.

551
00:31:39,550 --> 00:31:40,880
No matter how difficult,

552
00:31:40,880 --> 00:31:42,640
