576
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:56,240
and you are going to burn it down?

577
00:32:56,240 --> 00:32:57,720
Are you that greedy?

578
00:32:59,590 --> 00:33:00,590
Wait- wait!

579
00:33:00,880 --> 00:33:02,590
It was all yours to begin with.

580
00:33:06,160 --> 00:33:07,030
My daughter,

581
00:33:08,480 --> 00:33:10,070
can't you even leave me

582
00:33:10,070 --> 00:33:12,730
a bite to eat?

583
00:33:13,070 --> 00:33:15,400
Before you killed those innocent people,

584
00:33:16,230 --> 00:33:18,830
did you ever think of
leaving them a bite to eat?

585
00:33:21,830 --> 00:33:23,360
Have you quelled the flames

586
00:33:24,680 --> 00:33:26,210
of those vengeful spirits?

587
00:33:29,200 --> 00:33:30,070
For my mother,

588
00:33:30,480 --> 00:33:31,310
Jin Chunqing.

589
00:33:31,590 --> 00:33:32,470
For my father,

590
00:33:32,640 --> 00:33:33,480
Shen Zhibai.

591
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:35,290
And for those countless

592
00:33:36,070 --> 00:33:37,530
wronged souls you killed,

593
00:33:39,350 --> 00:33:40,880
We will return it all to you.

594
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:20,400
I originally planned

595
00:34:20,800 --> 00:34:22,190
to teach you

596
00:34:24,190 --> 00:34:26,440
one last lesson before I die.

597
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:29,800
I wanted to teach you

598
00:34:30,920 --> 00:34:33,280
to pay the price

599
00:34:33,670 --> 00:34:35,630
for your sins.

600
00:34:38,110 --> 00:34:39,320
But now...

601
00:34:40,230 --> 00:34:42,510
I can't save you anymore.

602
00:35:17,150 --> 00:35:20,080
Back then, I had a dream
during the Lantern Festival.

603
00:35:21,280 --> 00:35:24,010
All flowers faded during the full moon.

604
00:35:24,190 --> 00:35:26,800
The full moon refers to Qingyuan.

605
00:35:27,070 --> 00:35:28,360
I should have known.

606
00:35:31,230 --> 00:35:32,960
The century-old Xie family

607
00:35:33,510 --> 00:35:36,030
was destined to be destroyed

608
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:39,840
as soon as Qingyuan appeared.

609
00:35:43,920 --> 00:35:45,650
So, there really is such a thing

610
00:35:46,190 --> 00:35:47,920
as divine will in this world!

611
00:35:50,800 --> 00:35:53,030
My lifelong obsession

612
00:35:53,670 --> 00:35:54,880
amounts to nothing

613
00:35:55,510 --> 00:35:56,280
in the end...

614
00:35:57,030 --> 00:35:58,280
Nothing.

615
00:35:59,150 --> 00:36:01,360
Yet it cost so many lives.

616
00:36:03,030 --> 00:36:06,150
The blood on my hands
can never be washed clean.

617
00:36:06,480 --> 00:36:07,320
So be it.

618
00:36:07,020 --> 00:36:08,110
[Fuyu Pavilion]

619
00:36:09,280 --> 00:36:11,480
Let the fire destroy it.

620
00:36:11,920 --> 00:36:13,710
Let it destroy everything!

621
00:36:14,590 --> 00:36:15,560
Chunqing!

622
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:17,040
Mother!

623
00:36:18,120 --> 00:36:20,310
I am here to atone!

624
00:36:37,320 --> 00:36:38,180
I didn't expect

625
00:36:38,570 --> 00:36:40,370
that he would choose to die here.

626
00:36:41,510 --> 00:36:43,710
Perhaps it’s only when a person is dying

627
00:36:43,920 --> 00:36:46,780
that they truly come to understand
certain things.

628
00:36:46,840 --> 00:36:48,440
He probably wanted to atone.

629
00:37:19,400 --> 00:37:24,970
[Spring comes to Changmen]

630
00:37:25,130 --> 00:37:30,980
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

631
00:37:31,120 --> 00:37:38,360
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

632
00:37:37,170 --> 00:37:41,240
[Zhongwu Hall]

633
00:37:38,380 --> 00:37:41,740
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

634
00:37:41,770 --> 00:37:45,470
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

635
00:37:45,490 --> 00:37:52,340
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

636
00:37:52,410 --> 00:37:59,770
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

637
00:37:53,630 --> 00:37:55,280
When I left Hengtang,

638
00:37:55,440 --> 00:37:57,240
I made a promise to Fourth Sister

639
00:37:57,550 --> 00:37:59,550
that I would open Yunji Snacks branches

640
00:37:59,550 --> 00:38:00,840
all over the world.

641
00:37:59,790 --> 00:38:06,620
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

642
00:38:01,960 --> 00:38:03,070
And now,

643
00:38:03,440 --> 00:38:05,500
there is even a branch in the capital.

644
00:38:05,590 --> 00:38:08,030
I consider that I have kept my promise.

645
00:38:06,650 --> 00:38:10,670
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

646
00:38:07,980 --> 00:38:13,280
[Zhongwu Hall]

647
00:38:08,920 --> 00:38:10,520
The old Marquis passed away,

648
00:38:10,730 --> 00:38:14,160
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

649
00:38:11,110 --> 00:38:13,510
and Old Madam
went to a manor to recuperate.

650
00:38:13,760 --> 00:38:15,360
The Marquis is busy in the army,

651
00:38:14,220 --> 00:38:21,570
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

652
00:38:15,960 --> 00:38:18,320
leaving early
and returning late every day.

653
00:38:18,320 --> 00:38:19,800
Madam, you're left alone

654
00:38:20,710 --> 00:38:22,110
in the residence.

655
00:38:21,600 --> 00:38:28,240
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

656
00:38:28,260 --> 00:38:35,510
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

657
00:38:33,190 --> 00:38:34,550
Teacher, this hairpin of yours

658
00:38:34,550 --> 00:38:35,670
is elegant and unique.

659
00:38:35,530 --> 00:38:39,240
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

660
00:38:36,070 --> 00:38:38,320
It complements
the flower shadows in the poem

661
00:38:38,320 --> 00:38:39,480
and adds a touch of tranquility.

662
00:38:39,270 --> 00:38:42,900
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

663
00:38:41,920 --> 00:38:43,590
Even if you praise me more,

664
00:38:43,020 --> 00:38:48,920
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

665
00:38:44,480 --> 00:38:46,340
you still have to pay for the book.

666
00:38:49,190 --> 00:38:50,110
It's strange.

667
00:38:50,510 --> 00:38:51,480
Every shop

668
00:38:51,480 --> 00:38:52,740
looks almost the same.

669
00:38:52,880 --> 00:38:53,840
But once you enter,

670
00:38:53,840 --> 00:38:55,570
they are all different inside.

671
00:38:55,960 --> 00:38:57,400
The climate and geography are different,

672
00:38:57,400 --> 00:38:58,840
dietary habits are different,

673
00:38:58,840 --> 00:39:01,280
and individual constitutions
differ even more.

674
00:39:01,280 --> 00:39:02,400
Naturally, every shop

675
00:39:02,400 --> 00:39:04,800
has to adjust its prescriptions
according to the location.

676
00:39:04,800 --> 00:39:05,480
Only then

677
00:39:05,710 --> 00:39:08,710
can it be considered
prescribing the right medicine.

678
00:39:08,880 --> 00:39:11,880
Adjusting prescriptions
according to the location?

679
00:39:12,230 --> 00:39:13,590
Go put out the light.

680
00:39:14,320 --> 00:39:15,000
Madam.

681
00:39:15,230 --> 00:39:17,320
Why are you resting so early?

682
00:39:17,590 --> 00:39:18,510
In the past,

683
00:39:18,760 --> 00:39:20,960
didn't you always leave a light on
for the Marquis

684
00:39:20,960 --> 00:39:22,220
until the third watch?

685
00:39:23,070 --> 00:39:23,670
What if

686
00:39:24,400 --> 00:39:26,400
he comes back early tonight?

687
00:39:27,000 --> 00:39:27,760
What if...

688
00:39:28,190 --> 00:39:29,120
There is no need.

689
00:39:29,510 --> 00:39:35,580
[Zhongwu Hall]

690
00:39:30,030 --> 00:39:31,290
Even if the light is on,

691
00:39:32,750 --> 00:39:33,840
it only illuminates

692
00:39:33,840 --> 00:39:35,440
an empty room.

693
00:39:44,840 --> 00:39:46,480
The money for the book is a small matter.

694
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:48,880
I passed by your place
and saw the door ajar.

695
00:39:50,230 --> 00:39:51,830
May I sit with you for a while?

696
00:39:53,230 --> 00:39:54,590
In your life,

697
00:39:55,400 --> 00:39:57,880
you won't just meet Mr. Zhou.

698
00:39:56,640 --> 00:40:03,820
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

699
00:39:59,000 --> 00:40:01,710
You will meet so many people.

700
00:40:03,070 --> 00:40:05,110
You will live a good life.

701
00:40:03,850 --> 00:40:10,470
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

702
00:40:08,540 --> 00:40:11,090
[Zhongwu Hall]

703
00:40:10,570 --> 00:40:18,210
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

704
00:40:17,640 --> 00:40:20,070
[Zhongwu Hall]

705
00:40:18,330 --> 00:40:25,630
♪ Quietly waiting in the passage of time
for a reply ♪

706
00:40:22,830 --> 00:40:24,210
Darling.

707
00:40:25,770 --> 00:40:32,700
♪ Listening to every word, every line,
everything about you ♪

708
00:40:29,240 --> 00:40:30,030
Darling!

709
00:40:32,800 --> 00:40:42,980
♪ Your gentle breath,
the traces left by longing ♪

710
00:40:33,590 --> 00:40:34,850
The arrow's fletching

711
00:40:35,070 --> 00:40:37,400
tore through the cloth you wrapped for me.

712
00:40:37,550 --> 00:40:38,550
Please, darling,

713
00:40:40,280 --> 00:40:41,940
repair it for me one more time.

714
00:40:43,160 --> 00:40:50,340
♪ No sight could ever compare to you,
forever in my heart ♪

715
00:40:50,360 --> 00:40:57,530
♪ My every joy and sorrow has become
part of your journey ♪

716
00:40:57,560 --> 00:41:01,140
♪ A lifetime, devoted only to you ♪

717
00:41:01,160 --> 00:41:04,780
♪ Giving you all the love in my heart ♪

718
00:41:04,810 --> 00:41:11,220
♪ Our paths have never truly parted ♪

719
00:41:06,630 --> 00:41:07,670
My wife

720
00:41:08,110 --> 00:41:09,110
is so impressive.

721
00:41:10,150 --> 00:41:11,320
It seems your medical skills

722
00:41:11,320 --> 00:41:13,320
are catching up with your mother's.

723
00:41:26,510 --> 00:41:32,980
♪ If the wind softly whispers your name ♪

724
00:41:33,090 --> 00:41:40,250
♪ If my heart softly hears your voice ♪

725
00:41:40,430 --> 00:41:47,790
♪ I'm still here,
holding on to our memories ♪

